sfer wide receiver Wyatt Young committed to Oklahoma State, a source told ESPN on Sunday.","published":"2026-01-05T01:21:19.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/47507561/north-texas-wr-wyatt-young-commits-oklahoma-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"BYU retains CFP hopes, beats Kansas in triple overtime","description":"Bear Bachmeier connected with Jojo Phillips in the back of the end zone in the third overtime, helping No. 10 BYU beat Kansas to keep its CFP hopes alive.","published":"2026-11-21T21:23:55.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50553754/byu-retains-cfp-hopes-beats-kansas-triple-over","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Nebraska snaps AP Top 25 losing skid, upsets Ohio State","description":"Nebraska broke its 31-game losing streak against AP Top 25 opponents with a 31-28 victory over No. 16 Ohio State on Saturday.","published":"2026-11-21T21:11:45.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50553426/nebraska-snaps-ap-top-25-losing-skid-upsets-ohio-state","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Nebraska's Matt Rhule ends his drought against ranked opponents","description":"Rhule and Nebraska brought an end to the Cornhuskers coach's infamous decade-long streak against Ohio State.","published":"2026-11-21T20:58:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50534102/nebraska-cornhuskers-matt-rhule-ranked-win-drought","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Syracuse QB Steve Angeli exits with injury, arm in sling","description":"Syracuse senior quarterback Steve Angeli left Saturday's game against Boston College with an injury to his throwing arm and will not return.","published":"2026-11-21T20:51:03.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50552810/syracuse-qb-steve-angeli-exits-injury-arm-sling","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Jake Trotter","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Week 12 live: Tracking top moments and best highlights","description":"Tracking the top plays and developments from Week 12.","published":"2026-11-21T18:35:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50541394/week-12-live-highlights","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Army pulls seating prank at Navy's football stadium ahead of Memphis game","description":"The letters were adjusted back in time for Navy's kickoff.","published":"2026-11-21T18:47:15.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50551457/army-navy-seat-prank","type":"Story","byline":"Associated Press","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Houston QB Conner Weigman out; Keisean Henderson gets start","description":"Houston ruled out starting QB Conner Weigman vs. West Virginia due to injury and instead went with true freshman Keisean Henderson, the No. 4 recruit for 2026.","published":"2026-11-21T18:43:55.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50550966/sources-houston-qb-conner-weigman-henderson-start","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-21T16:04:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-21T16:00:59.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5148787/wyatt-young","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wyatt_Young"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Wyatt Young","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wyatt_Young","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:29Z","intro":"Wyatt Young is an American football wide receiver for the Oklahoma State Cowboys. He previously played for the North Texas Mean Green.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Young attended Obra D. Tompkins High School in Fort Bend County, Texas, and would originally commit to play college football for the Rice Owls before committing to play for the North Texas Mean Green."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"NORTH TEXAS\nIn week three of the 2024 season, Young brought in a 75-yard touchdown reception versus Texas Tech. As a freshman in 2024, Young hauled in 18 passes for 295 yards and two touchdowns. In week 8 of the 2025 season, he totaled six receptions for 102 yards and three touchdowns in a win over UTSA. In week 13, Young hauled in eight passes for 295 yards and two touchdowns in a victory against Rice. He finished the 2025 season with 70 catches for 1,264 yards and ten touchdowns. For his performance he earned first-team all-American Conference honors as well as being named a PFSN First Team All-American. After the season, he entered the NCAA transfer portal.\n\nOKLAHOMA STATE\nYoung transferred to play for the Oklahoma State Cowboys over other offers from schools such as Louisville, Michigan, and Missouri."}]}}